    ":absence/basis names, with file:line pointers or a run-record id, the measurement the kind was read off; a kind with no basis is a preference"
    "a label CHANGES NO VERDICT and is not a repair. The row it names keeps its :typed-absence for good, because the rows are append-only; the label says only which of the two responses that standing absence calls for"
